.th NEWS I 4/22/75
.sh NAME
news \*- news distribution program
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd news
[ option ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it News
is used to print the news file, or to update the news file.
.it News
with no option prints the standard news file.
.s3
The legal options are:
.s3
.ft I
.lp +8 7
option	meaning
.ft R
.s3
.lp +8 7
s	send the standard input to the news file.
.s3
.lp +8 7
p	print the standard news file.
.s3
.lp +8 7
o	print the old news file.
.s3
.lp +8 7
h	print the history news file.
.i0
.dt
.s3
.it News
with the
.bd s
option works like the
.it mail
(I) command.
.sh FILES
.nf
.if t .ta 1.2i
.if n .ta 20
/usr/news/mailbox	current news
/usr/news/mbox	old news
/usr/news/history	history of system development
/bin/cat	to print news
/bin/mail	to send news
.fi
.dt
.sh "SEE ALSO"
cat (I), mail (I)
.sh AUTHOR
Mike Tilson
.sh BUGS
